title: Classic DLL Injection via CreateRemoteThread
id: 7949dfcc-13d3-48e5-9a13-ecef70e8b264
status: experimental
description: Detects a remote thread created in another process whose start address resolves to LoadLibrary, the classic DLL-injection technique for loading an attacker DLL into a victim process.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/001/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: create_remote_thread
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 8
    StartFunction|contains:
      - 'LoadLibrary'
      - 'LoadLibraryA'
      - 'LoadLibraryW'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SourceImage
  - TargetImage
falsepositives:
  - Some security products inject via LoadLibrary
level: high
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1055.001
